Smash your shield into the face of all adjacent foes dealing [167%, 194%, 216%, 234%, 250% (TL1-5)] shield damage and knocking them back [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] grids.

In addition, all creatures knocked back will also be dazed for [3, 5, 7, 9, 11 (STR 10-100)] turns.

If known, activating this talent will refresh your Rush cooldown if the attack hits.

The distance increases with your talent level, and the Daze duration with your Strength.
